!theme plain
title FP Session Lifecycle Management

state "Session Pool" as Pool {
    state "Available" as Available
    state "Active" as Active
    state "Timeout Tracking" as Tracking
}

state "Client Session Lifecycle" as ClientLifecycle {
    state "Client Idle" as ClientIdle
    state "Request Sent" as RequestSent
    state "Waiting Response" as WaitingResp
    state "Response Received" as RespReceived
    state "Client Timeout" as ClientTimeout
}

state "Server Session Lifecycle" as ServerLifecycle {
    state "Server Idle" as ServerIdle
    state "ARM Received" as ARMReceived
    state "Armed & Waiting" as ArmedWaiting
    state "FIRE Received" as FIREReceived
    state "Operation Executed" as OpExecuted
    state "DISARM Received" as DISARMReceived
    state "Server Timeout" as ServerTimeout
}

' Client session transitions
ClientIdle --> RequestSent : fp_disp_client_send_req()
RequestSent --> Available : [Session allocation failed]
RequestSent --> WaitingResp : [Session allocated]
WaitingResp --> RespReceived : [Response arrives]
WaitingResp --> ClientTimeout : [Timeout elapsed]
RespReceived --> ClientIdle : [Session closed]
ClientTimeout --> ClientIdle : [Session closed]

' Server session transitions
ServerIdle --> ARMReceived : [ARM request arrives]
ARMReceived --> Available : [Validation failed]
ARMReceived --> ArmedWaiting : [ARM validated & session created]
ArmedWaiting --> FIREReceived : [FIRE request arrives]
ArmedWaiting --> DISARMReceived : [DISARM request arrives]
ArmedWaiting --> ServerTimeout : [15 min timeout]
FIREReceived --> OpExecuted : [Hash validation passed]
FIREReceived --> ArmedWaiting : [Hash validation failed]
OpExecuted --> ServerIdle : [Session closed]
DISARMReceived --> ServerIdle : [Session closed]
ServerTimeout --> ServerIdle : [Session auto-closed]

' Session pool management
Available --> Active : [Session allocated]
Active --> Tracking : [Session in use]
Tracking --> Available : [Session released]

note right of ClientLifecycle
  Client Session Features:
  - Request/response matching
  - Timeout management
  - Sync/async support
  - Event signaling
  - Response buffering
end note

note right of ServerLifecycle
  Server Session Features:
  - ARM-and-FIRE tracking
  - Data hash validation
  - 15-minute timeout
  - State persistence
  - Automatic cleanup
end note

note bottom of Pool
  Session Pool Management:
  - Pre-allocated sessions
  - Configurable limits
  - Thread-safe allocation
  - Metrics tracking
  - Resource protection
end note

@enduml
